WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:04.054
You swept eleven service
principals and twenty grants,

3
00:00:04.054 --> 00:00:06.888
found the broad grants
with no current exception,

4
00:00:06.888 --> 00:00:11.450
and handed three privileged service
principals to the Privileged Access plan.

5
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:16.049
You read the open rows of the quarter's
owner review, applied three approved

6
00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:20.425
changes to the fake, and saw the write
path refuse a plan nobody reviewed.

7
00:00:20.425 --> 00:00:25.842
The evidence an ISSO keeps for Gate 4 from
this module is the sweep, the findings,

8
00:00:25.842 --> 00:00:31.008
the hand-off, the owner review and its
status, the plan with its approved hash,

9
00:00:31.008 --> 00:00:34.675
and the apply folder's results
and manifest, all dated.

10
00:00:34.675 --> 00:00:37.750
Before you ship, work through
the chapter's checklist.

11
00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:42.422
Next is Module 6: Conditional
Access for workload identities,

12
00:00:42.422 --> 00:00:44.230
the other half of Gate 4.
